    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omukama Hoseya owa Isirairi.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogwa ikumi n'ebiri ogw'engoma y'Ahazi omukama wa Yuda, Hoseya mutabani w'Ela, nubwo yatandikire kulema Isirairi omu rubuga Samaliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakora MUKAMA ebi atasiima, baitu atasisane abakama aba Isirairi abaamwebembiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoseya omukama w'Asiriya akaramagira Ahazi; Hoseya yafooka mwiru we, yaikara naamuha omusoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu omukama w'Asiriya akarora Hoseya nkooku akaba ali ncwangya; habwokuba akaba atumire abakwenda hali Sso, omukama wa Misiri, yayanga kuha omukama w'Asiriya omusoro, nkooku yakoraga buli mwaka; habweki omukama w'Asiriya nukwo kumukwata yamuta omu nkomo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma omukama ow'Asiriya, akaramagira ensi yoona, yahika na Samaliya, yagigota okumara emyaka esatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogwa mwenda ogw'engoma ya Hoseya, omukama w'Asiriya nubwo yakwasire Samaliya, Abaisirairi yabatwara Asiriya, yabata omu rubuga Haala, banu yabata haihi n'ekisaaru Habora, ekinyakuli omu isaza lya Gozani, abandi yabata omu mbuga eza Media.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki kikabaho, habwokuba abantu ba Isirairi bakabiihiza MUKAMA Ruhanga wabo ayabaihire omunsi Misiri, ayabajunire Faraaho omukama wa Misiri, baaramya baaruhanga abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakwata engeso ez'amahanga MUKAMA aga yabingire abantu be Abaisirairi batakaizire, n'engeso abakama ba Isirairi ezi baaleesire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisirairi baakoraga omu nsita ebintu MUKAMA Ruhanga wabo ebi akaba atarukusiima. Omu mbuga zaabo zoona, okurugirra ha munaara ogw'abalinzi okuhika ha rubuga oruzitiriirwe, bakeeyombekeramu ebiikaro eby'ekitiinisa eby'okuramizaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 14:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakeekorra ebisisani eby'amabaale, hansozi zoona eziraihire na hansi y'emiti yoona emibisi, baatayo ekisisani ky'omucwezi Asera; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biikaro eby'ekitiinisa ebi byona nuho baacumiikirirraga obubbaani, nk'amahanga MUKAMA aga yabingire bbo batakaizire oku gaakoraga. Bakakora ebintu ebibi ebirukubiihiza MUKAMA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakaramya abacwezi MUKAMA aba yabatangire naagamba ati: “Eki mutalikikora.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu MUKAMA akeekonyeza abarangi boona n'abahabuzi naagamba ati: “Mucwe engeso zanyu embi, mukwatege Ebiragiro byange n'ebigambo byange, ebiragiro byona ebi naragiire baisenkurwinywe, n'ebi nabatwekiire nimbirabya omu baheereza bange abarangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu bakanga kuhurra, baaba ngumangani nka baisenkurubo abataraikiriize MUKAMA Ruhanga wabo oku baabaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakagaya ebiragiro bye n'endagaano ye ei yakozire na baisenkurubo, n'ebigambo ebi yabahabwire. Bakaramya abacwezi ab'ebisuba, nabo nukwo kufooka banyabisuba. “Embuzi erwaire obunyamunwa togisibika n'eyawe;” bakakwata engeso ez'amahanga agakaba gabeehinguliriize, MUKAMA aga akaba abantangire naagamba ati: “Mutalikora nk'abo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 12:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga wabo byona, bakabyanga baayekorra enyana ibiri ezi baayagize omu bintu eby'omu itaka; baakora n'ekisisani eky'omucwezi Asera, baaramya ebintu byona eby'omu mwanya, kandi baahereza Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 18:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakookya batabani baabu na bahara baabu babe bihongwa, baabandwaga kandi baarogaga, bakeemarra ha kukora ebintu ebibi MUKAMA ebi atagonza, nukwo kumubiihiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, MUKAMA akabiihirirwa muno Abaisirairi, nukwo kubahwerekereza hatasigale n'omu, okwihaho oruganda rwa Yuda rwonka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oruganda rwa Yuda narwo rutakwate Ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga wabo, baitu bakakwata engeso Abaisirairi ezi bakaba baleesire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA nukwo kutonda abaijukuru ba Isirairi yababonabonesa, yabalekera abanyagi babanyaga, okuhika obu yabahwerekeriize yabamaraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA obu yamazire kwiha Isirairi omunju ya Daudi, Yerobbowamu mutabani wa Nebati nuwe baafoora MUKAMA. Yerobbowamu akabatanga kukuraatira MUKAMA, yabakoza ebibi ebitagambwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisirairi ebibi byona Yerobbowamu ebi yakozire batabireke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okuhika MUKAMA obu yabahwerekeriize yabamaraho nkooku akaba agambire naaraba omu baheereza be boona abarangi. Abaisirairi nukwo kusuuhurwa baaruga omunsi yabo yonyini baatwarwa Asiriya nambere bali okuhika na hati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abantu abaagarukire Samaliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMUKAMA w'Asiriya, akaiha abantu; Babbulooni, Kuusa, Ava, Hamasi, na Sefavaimu, yabata omu mbuga za Samaliya, omu kiikaro ky'abantu ba Isirairi; Baalya ensi Samaliya, baikara omu mbuga zaayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu bakaba nibakyatandika kwikara oku, batatiine MUKAMA; na uwe nukwo kubanagamu entale, ezaisire abamu omuli bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bakagambira omukama w'Asiriya ngu; “abantu aba watwaire wata omu mbuga za Samaliya, tibamanyire biragiro bya ruhanga ow'ensi egi”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo omukama w'Asiriya yaragiire ati: “Mutwekeyo omu ha banyakatagara aba mwaihireyo, agende aikaleyo, nuwe araabeegesa ebiragiro ebya ruhanga ow'ensi egi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omu ha banyakatagara aba bakaba baihire Samaliya akagenda yaikara Beseeri, yayegesa abantu nkooku basemeriire kutiina MUKAMA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu nabwo, buli ihanga likoongera kwekorra baaruhanga baalyo, baabata omu maju ag'ebiikaro eby'ekitiinisa Abasamaliya ebi bakaba bombekere, buli ihanga erikaba liri omu mbuga ezi lyaikaramuga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abantu aba Babbulooni bakakora Sukoosi-be-nosi; aba Kuusi bakakora Neregaali; aba Hamasi bakakora Asima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ab'Ava bakakora Nibuhaazi na Tarutaaki; aba Savaimu baikara nibokya abaana baabu nibabahongera baaruhanga baabu. Aduramaleki n'Anameleki baaruhanga aba Sefavaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abo nabo, baatiinaga MUKAMA, bakeekomamu abantu aba buli mulingo, baabafoora banyakatagara aba ha biikaro ebi eby'ekitiinisa, nubo baabatambiraga ebyonzira omu biikaro ebi eby'ekitiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo, baatiinaga MUKAMA, baitu kandi baaheerezaaga baaruhanga baabu, nibahondera engeso ez'amahanga aga bakaba baihirwemu. “Haa, obunura bubiri bwata amatama, abinga ibiri imusiga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.32.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 32:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.35.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahati hoona, engeso yabo egi eya ira bakyagirumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibaatiina MUKAMA, tibakuratira biragiro, tibakwata bigambo MUKAMA ebi yaragiire abaana ba Yakobbo ou yarukire ibara Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 20:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 5:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akakora nabo endagaano yabateererra ati mutalikisura mukaramya baaruhanga abandi, mutalibainamira, mutalibaheereza kandi mutalibatambira ebyonzira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 6:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutiinege nyowe MUKAMA ayabaihire omunsi Misiri, ninyoleka obusobozi n'amaani; ninyowe mwinamirege kandi ninyowe mutambirege ebyonzira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutehoga omutima okuhikiriza ebiragiro n'okukwata ebigambo ebi nabahandikiire, mutaliramya baaruhanga abandi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mutalyebwa endagaano ei nakozire nainywe, mutalitiina baaruhanga abandi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu mutiinege nyowe MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu, ninyowe ndibajuna abanyanzigwa banyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu nabwo bakalema kuhurra, baakakora byona nibakuraatira engeso zaabo ezaira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abo nukwo baatiinaga MUKAMA bati, kandi nukwo baaheerezaaga baaruhanga baabo ababaizirwe omu miti rundi omu mabaale; abaana baabo n'abaijukuru baabo nka baisenkurubo oku baakozire, nabo nukwo barukukora na ha kiro kinu. Mazimakwo “Embeba enkuru, niyo eyegesa ento kupekenya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
